Derived Python modules were renamed from sma to fedscan, and their comments,
docstrings, and debug print statements were removed. Original attribution is
retained here. The original client and retrieval evaluator were adapted to
remove simulation branches. The server was adapted to use FedSCAN with clean
clients only. The aggregation numerical operations are retained from the source.

Download scripts retain the original download sources and are scoped to their
own directories. The CLIP model download helper and packaging metadata were
added for this release.
